### HabitFlowAI API Test Suite
### Use REST Client extension in VS Code to run these requests
### Remember: Get a fresh token from login/register and update the Authorization header

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@email = test@example.com
@password = TestPassword123!

### ===== AUTHENTICATION TESTS =====

### 1. Register new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. Login user (use the token from register response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

